 no piensa regresar nunca más a Venezuela." type="episode" contentRating="M/16" duration="3600000" grandparentArt="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vchp-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/69434d180ce26850f68da2c9" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/69434d180ce26850f68da2c9" grandparentRatingKey="69434d180ce26850f68da2c9" grandparentThumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/show/thumbnails/widescreen/2000x2858/vchp-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentTitle="Cuando Hay Pasión" grandparentType="show" index="22" originallyAvailableAt="2026-06-16T00:00:00Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vchp-thum-wide.jpg" title="Cuando Hay Pasion - Episodio 145: Bodas, un Nuevo Inicio y Despedidas" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Cuando Hay Pasion - Episodio 145: Bodas, un Nuevo Inicio y Despedidas" type="coverArt" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vchp-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Cuando Hay Pasion - Episodio 145: Bodas, un Nuevo Inicio y Despedidas" type="coverPoster" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/show/thumbnails/widescreen/2000x2858/vchp-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Cuando Hay Pasion - Episodio 145: Bodas, un Nuevo Inicio y Despedidas" type="snapshot" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vchp-thum-wide.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" id="6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" ratingKey="genre_6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" slug="en-espanol" tag="En Español" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1784516400" duration="3600000" endsAt="1784520000" id="6a5432ee801ae28ed7bbaffe" live="0" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video guid="plex://episode/6a4d9c7de04bab4cf3034b08" key="/library/metadata/6a4d9c7de04bab4cf3034b08" ratingKey="6a4d9c7de04bab4cf3034b08" summary="Junior corteja a Rosa rumbo a la residencia, pero ella lo rechaza recordando la muerte de su hermano. Maricela ataca a Adolfo en plena ebriedad delante de Andreína y Rosalía. Rosa, ilusionada con Alejandro, lo ve partir sin saber que él fue a un compromiso forzado. Consuelo discute con Rosa creéndola ladrona, sin sospechar que es su hija perdida; luego se arrepiente. Eustoquio, instigado por Erasto, revela a Isaías que Consuelo tuvo una hija con Adolfo, sembrando el odio que destruirá a la familia." type="episode" contentRating="M/16" duration="3600000" grandparentArt="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vpda-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a3c783f1c9ab3c10e21a9c7" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a3c783f1c9ab3c10e21a9c7" grandparentRatingKey="6a3c783f1c9ab3c10e21a9c7" grandparentThumb="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg" grandparentTitle="Pecado de Amor" grandparentType="show" index="10" originallyAvailableAt="2026-06-16T00:00:00Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vpda-thum-wide.jpg" title="Episodio 10" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episodio 10" type="coverArt" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vpda-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 10" type="coverPoster" url="https://provider-static.plex.tv/epg/cms/production/f0264004-d833-4809-8173-dc12f75e70e0/Novelisima_vert_2000x3000_-_Ali_Clausen.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 10" type="snapshot" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vpda-thum-wide.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" id="6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" ratingKey="genre_6171e01d4c451f5